OL,5,G1855 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FLisa Holloway prides herself on
OL,7,     Fproviding a home from home at
OL,8,     FCompton House in Newark,
OL,9,     FNottinghamshire. But there are
OL,10,     Fdusty discoveries, and Dave and Jo
OL,11,     Ffind the prices hard to swallow.
OL,12,G1925 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FDave and Jo Bate hope that their
OL,14,     Fguests will embrace the pub vibe
OL,15,     Fat The White Horse in Ripon, North
OL,16,     FYorkshire. But Ed and Jane get
OL,17,     Flocked in their room and it's
OL,18,     F'tomatogate' at breakfast.
