OL,5,G1955 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FFormer teachers Ed and Jane host
OL,7,     Fat The Old Farmhouse in Cheshire.
OL,8,     FSome of their guests are surprised
OL,9,     Fto be sharing a bathroom, and Sam
OL,10,     Fand Ian are shocked by what's
OL,11,     Flurking under the bed.
OL,12,G2025 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe B&Bers meet for one last time
OL,14,     Fto settle some scores and find out
OL,15,     Fhow much they've been paid. A
OL,16,     Fheated exchange about cleaning
OL,17,     Fleads to tears before the winner
OL,18,     Fis announced.
